    "reviews": "\u201cMidnight Fight Express is a modern beat-'em-up with extensive motion-captured animations that bring its frenetic combat to life with wince-inducing satisfaction.\u201d<br>8 / 10 \u2013 GameSpot<br><br>\u201cWith combat that\u2019s as brutal as it is satisfying and a progression system that truly makes you feel like you\u2019re mastering the craft of kicking arse\u201d<br>9 / 10 \u2013 WellPlayed<br><br>\u201cMidnight Fight Express takes a cool look, great music, and fluid combat to the next level in one of this year's best beat-em-ups.\u201d<br>8 / 10 \u2013 GamingBolt<br>",
